 Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=A%20handful%20of%20Jigme,of%20the%20babbling%20river.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e2","era":null,"summary":"Dar scolds Kela for smiling and speaking, insisting the twins' justice rests on how they are perceived.","participants":["dar-chensal","kela-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":33,"quote":"You shall not show emotion. What we do, it's all about perception, Kela.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=You%20shall%20not%20show,all%20about%20perception%2C%20Kela.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=You%20shall%20not%20show,all%20about%20perception%2C%20Kela.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e3","era":null,"summary":"Elder Ngabo welcomes the Arbiter Twins to Jigme in the square.","participants":["elder-ngabo","kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-square","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":47,"quote":"I am Elder Ngabo. You honor us with your presence, Arbiter Twins.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=I%20am%20Elder%20Ngabo.,your%20presence%2C%20Arbiter%20Twins.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=I%20am%20Elder%20Ngabo.,your%20presence%2C%20Arbiter%20Twins.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e4","era":null,"summary":"The court hears the case against Lotse Taring, accused of stealing nine baskets of apples; Kela and Dar listen in deep meditation.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal","lotse-taring","elder-ngabo"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":57,"quote":"Nine baskets of apples had been stolen from the Village reserve.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Nine%20baskets%20of%20apples,from%20the%20Village%20reserve.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Nine%20baskets%20of%20apples,from%20the%20Village%20reserve.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e6","era":null,"summary":"Kela leaves her lamp unlit; Dar lights his, and the villagers declare Lotse guilty.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal",