nsal-twins-e10","era":null,"summary":"Kela invokes the Rules of the Reeds, and Dar reluctantly agrees to a quick judgment before the mob has Lotse's head.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":143,"quote":"But we will be quick.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=But%20we%20will%20be%20quick.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=But%20we%20will%20be%20quick.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e11","era":null,"summary":"Kela, locked in her tower, lights her lamp of innocence, producing two flames.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-tower-of-innocence","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":153,"quote":"Then she lit wick. The lamp of innocence ignited.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Then%20she%20lit%20wick.,lamp%20of%20innocence%20ignited.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Then%20she%20lit%20wick.,lamp%20of%20innocence%20ignited.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e12","era":null,"summary":"The mob storms the towers, and Kela escapes out the window on the air currents, pursued by Dar.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":161,"quote":"Kela sprang out through the window.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Kela%20sprang%20out%20through%20the%20window.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Kela%20sprang%20out%20through%20the%20window.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e13","era":null,"summary":"Dar claims to know the judgment and knocks Kela from the air; she falls to the ground and refuses to concede.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":167,"quote":"She lost her footing and her control and she plummeted to the ground.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20lost%20her%20footing,plummeted%20to%20the%20ground.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=She%20lost%20her%20footing,plummeted%20to%20the%20ground.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e14","era":null,"summary":"The twins fight the Combat of Clarity, and Kela, seeing everything clearly, defeats Dar.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal","combat-of-clarity"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":178,"quote":"Kela leapt into a spinning strike and landed in a crouch on the ground with her knee on Dar's chest and her blade at his throat.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Kela%20leapt%20into%20a,blade%20at%20his%20throat.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=Kela%20leapt%20into%20a,blade%20at%20his%20throat.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e15","era":null,"summary":"Kela spares Dar and offers him balance, and the twins stand before the villagers as equals.","participants":["kela-chensal","dar-chensal"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"major","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":184,"quote":"For the first time, they stood together before the villagers as equals.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=For%20the%20first%20time%2C,the%20villagers%20as%20equals.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=For%20the%20first%20time%2C,the%20villagers%20as%20equals.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}},{"id":"the-chensal-twins-e16","era":null,"summary":"Dar announces that Lotse will have a fair trial, and the girl from the tree rings the gong.","participants":["dar-chensal","the-girl-from-the-tree","kela-chensal","lotse-taring"],"location":"jigme-village","importance":"minor","page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"wizards","paragraph":185,"quote":"The man will have a fair trial,\" Dar said.","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=The%20man%20will%20have,fair%20trial%2C%22%20Dar%20said.","citation":{"source":"wizards","official":true,"publisher":"Wizards of the Coast","work":"The Chensal Twins","series":"Magic Story","authors":["Kimberly J. Kreines"],"date":"2014-10-15","url":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins","link":"https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/the-chensal-twins#:~:text=The%20man%20will%20have,fair%20trial%2C%22%20Dar%20said.","archived":null,"license":null,"text":"\"The Chensal Twins\" by Kimberly J. Kreines. Magic Story, Wizards of the Coast, 15 Oct 2014."}}],"relations":[{"page":"stories/the-chensal-twins","order":467,"story_date":"2014-10-15","storyline":"","source":"kela-chensal","id":"the-chensal-twins-r0","relation":"family","target":"dar-chensal","note":"Twin siblings; Dar was born the evening before Kela's morning birth."